			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description:\n9:16Vertical screen video. Realistic 3D rendering style with high-detail fur and fabric textures, warm-toned lighting, and natural light entering from a window on the right side, casting soft side-lighting and shadows across an indoor living room scene. Key props: a beige fabric sofa, a wooden coffee table, a framed painting on the wall, a potted green plant by the window, and a wooden side cabinet.\n\n[Shot 1] Static camera, medium shot, slightly low eye-level angle. The foreground shows the edge of the wooden coffee table; an orange cat in distressed clothing (a large orange long-haired cat wearing a green distressed baseball cap — with a prominent torn gap on the brim above the left ear — a white distressed short-sleeve T-shirt, a gray distressed vest, green distressed shorts, red socks, and black perforated sandals) sits at the center of the beige fabric sofa, positioned center-left, occupying approximately 60% of the frame's height; roughly 20% empty space on the right, with the left partially obscured by the coffee table; the potted green plant by the window and the wooden side cabinet compose the background on the rear right, the framed painting sits at the upper rear left of the subject, with clear depth of field.\n\nAt the opening, the orange cat in distressed clothing holds a silver smartphone to its right ear with its right forepaw, its left forepaw resting naturally on its left knee, legs apart, tail stretched toward the rear right; its facial expression is a smile, eyes wide open, mouth slightly parted. The orange cat in distressed clothing then maintains the phone-to-ear posture and nods its head gently twice; the corners of its mouth lift, eyes slightly narrowed, conveying a relaxed smile. The orange cat in distressed clothing (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 喂，哥。晚上出去喝酒去啊。</d>.\n\nNext, the orange cat in distressed clothing maintains the phone-holding posture and makes a minor adjustment to the phone's position with its right forepaw; its eyes briefly narrow then open wide, the arc of its smile unchanged. An off-screen voice (S2) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 住院了？</d>, while the orange cat in distressed clothing on screen keeps its lips closed.\n\nNext, the orange cat in distressed clothing holds the phone steadily with its right forepaw, without any displacement; its eyes suddenly open wide, pupils contracting, mouth slightly parted in a surprised expression. The orange cat in distressed clothing (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 啊住院啦。</d>\n\nNext, the orange cat in distressed clothing maintains the phone-holding posture unchanged; its eyes remain wide open, eyebrows slightly raised, mouth slightly parted sustaining a surprised expression. The orange cat in distressed clothing (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 怎怎么啦？</d>. An off-screen voice (S2) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 这不便秘吗？想抹点开塞露，我这眼神也不好，一着急拿错了。</d>, while the orange cat in distressed clothing on screen keeps its lips closed.\n\nNext, the orange cat in distressed clothing makes a slight adjustment to the phone's angle with its right forepaw; its eyes remain wide open, the corners of its mouth press slightly downward, showing a doubtful expression. Then, the orange cat in distressed clothing holds the phone steadily with no hand movement; its eyes stay wide open, brow lightly furrowed, mouth shape shifting slightly into a pensive expression. The orange cat in distressed clothing (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 拿出什么了?</d>. An off-screen voice (S2) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 五零二,给我粘上了。</d>, while the orange cat in distressed clothing on screen keeps its lips closed.\n\nNext, the orange cat in distressed clothing raises its left forepaw to cover its left eye and the bridge of its nose, its head tilting slightly forward; its eyes narrow, the corners of its mouth lift in a suppressed-laughter expression. Finally, the orange cat in distressed clothing continues to cover its face with its left forepaw, its body leaning to the rear right and sinking downward, ultimately burying its head into the crook of its left arm with only part of its back and tail visible; its face is fully concealed, and its body posture transitions from sitting upright to a tendency toward a curled side-lying position.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nNatural ambient indoor living room sound with a faint interior background noise; throughout the phone call, the natural sounds of vocalization synchronized with lip movements, along with the subtle fabric friction of the beige sofa produced by head nods and slight body shifts.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
				1344,
